134/ohio-state-jeremiah-smith-sets-big-ten-receiving-record","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tracking Ohio State WR Jeremiah Smith's record-setting 2026 season","description":"Ohio State's superstar receiver has made breaking records a weekly occurrence this fall.","published":"2026-11-14T18:05:18.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50142903/jeremiah-smith-ohio-state-record-tracker","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Alabama makes last-second call to start QB Keelon Russell","description":"No. 3 Alabama made a last-second decision to start Keelon Russell against Vanderbilt after the quarterback looked better than anticipated in pregame warmups.","published":"2026-11-14T18:56:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50480988/alabama-makes-last-second-call-start-qb-keelon-russell","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Maryland QB Malik Washington doesn't start vs. Wisconsin","description":"Maryland quarterback Malik Washington did not start against Wisconsin as he continues to deal with a lower-body injury.","published":"2026-11-14T17:50:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50480722/source-maryland-qb-malik-washington-start-vs-wisconsin","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Colorado upsets No. 14 Houston for first AP top-15 win since 2007","description":"Colorado posted its first victory over an AP top-15 team since 2007 in beating No. 14 Houston 42-32 and slightly cooled down the hot seat for coach Deion Sanders.","published":"2026-11-14T14:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50479172/colorado-upsets-no-14-houston-1st-ap-top-15-win-2007","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ole Miss-Oklahoma bumped to Sunday despite Sooners AD's 'strong objection'","description":"Oklahoma AD Roger Denny was critical of the SEC's decision to mov